y","name":"Lycath's Hunt","imageName":"https://img.arsenyx.com/WerewolfLeap-c2a40ede.png","description":"(TAP) Lycath hunts to sustain the pack. Enemies killed by melee attacks drop health orbs and enemies killed by headshots drop energy orbs. Increase the duration of Lycath's hunt by killing enemies affected by 5 or more Status Effects.\r\n\r\n(HOLD) Lycath guards Voruna with increased Heavy Attack efficiency.","source":"Voruna"},{"uniqueName":"/Lotus/Powersuits/PowersuitAbilities/HelminthStunAbility","name":"Marked for Death","imageName":"https://img.arsenyx.com/HelminthStunAbility-24b6cee8.png","description":"Stun an enemy; a portion of the next damage you deal to it will be dealt to all enemies around it.","source":"Helminth"},{"uniqueName":"/Lotus/Powersuits/PowersuitAbilities/HelminthCompanionAbility","name":"Master's Summons","imageName":"https://img.arsenyx.com/HelminthCompanionAbility-36e76afd.png","description":"Heal your companion and call it to your side.","source":"Helminth"},{"uniqueName":"/Lotus/Powersuits/Jade/Abilities/MindControlAbility","name":"Mind Control","imageName":"https://img.arsenyx.com/NyxMindControl-5679d716.png","description":"Nyx seizes control of a target's mind, compelling them to fight for the Tenno cause. Controlled enemies have increased <DT_RADIATION_COLOR>Radiation Status Chance. When Nyx shoots them, they also have an increased Damage Multiplier.","source":"Nyx","stats":[{"label":"Energy Cost: |val1|","scale":"efficiency","values":[25]},{"label":"Range: |val1|m","scale":"range","values":[60]},{"label":"Duration: |val1|s","scale":"duration","values":[30]},{"label":"Stun Duration: |val1|s","values":[3]},{"label":"Damage Immunity: |val1|%","values":[100]},{"label":"Damage Conversion Duration: |val1|s","values":[4]},{"label":"Max Target Limit: |val1|","values":[1]}]},{"uniqueName":"/Lotus/Powersuits/Saryn/Abilities/ShedAbility","name":"Molt","imageName":"https://img.arsenyx.com/SarynMoult-1db2918b.png","description":"Shedding her s