ally succeed at your next hack attempt.","source":"Helminth"},{"uniqueName":"/Lotus/Powersuits/Brawler/Abilities/BrawlerGazeAbility","name":"Petrify","imageName":"https://img.arsenyx.com/AtlasStoneGaze-784893a0.png","description":"Atlas' hardened gaze will fossilize foes increasing the damage they take, heal Rumblers, and create Petrified Bulwarks. When shattered, petrified enemies drop healing Rubble for Atlas.","source":"Atlas","stats":[{"label":"Energy Cost: |val1|","scale":"efficiency","values":[75]},{"label":"Rumbler Heal: |val1|%","scale":"strength","values":[100]},{"label":"Cone Length: |val1|m","scale":"range","values":[14]},{"label":"Duration: |val1|s","scale":"duration","values":[20]},{"label":"Fov: |val1|°","values":[60]},{"label":"Damage Vulnerability: +|val1|%","values":[50]},{"label":"Rubble Dropped Per Enemy: |val1|","values":[1]}]},{"uniqueName":"/Lotus/Powersuits/IronFrame/Abilities/IronFrameStripAbility","name":"Pillage","imageName":"https://img.arsenyx.com/HildrynShieldPillage-aa38b2a0.png","description":"Pillage a percentage of Shields and Armor of nearby enemies to replenish Hildryn's own Shields and Overshields. Also removes Status Effects from Hildryn and her allies.","source":"Hildryn","stats":[{"label":"Energy Cost: |val1|","scale":"efficiency","values":[0]},{"label":"Shield/Armor Drain Per Enemy: |val1|%","scale":"strength","values":[25]},{"label":"Pulse Initial Radius: |val1|m","scale":"range","values":[8]},{"label":"Expansion Duration: |val1|s","scale":"duration","values":[2]},{"label":"Expansion Distance Per Sec: |val1|m/s","values":[20]},{"label":"Status Cleanse On Cast: |val1|%","values":[100]}]},{"uniqueName":"/Lotus/Powersuits/Mag/Abilities/PullAbility","name":"Pull","imageName":"https://img.arsenyx.com/MagPull-a87a494d.png","description":"Mag stuns enemies as she manifests a magnetic vortex. The vortex pulls in Polarize Shards and stunned enemies to place them directly in front of her.","source":"Mag","stats":[{"label":"Energy Cost: